                                                "sense_id": "c867f53e-c57e-3410-ab0f-653a96e11f64",
                                                "text": "...that took them to a brief rise of marble stairs that should've put them on the third-and-a-halfth floor if it'd been anywhere but Hogwarts, and then it was back to tiled stone pavement again, and..."
